<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>B.I.L.L.S.</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Towa Bird</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">B.I.L.L.S.</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7xISBLSpkANttnZx8krkq6</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.860" end="00:06.010">Bills</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.010" end="00:09.740">I'm so tired of paying rent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.740" end="00:13.120">I'm so tired of the B-I-L-L-S</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.120" end="00:18.270">I'm so tired of writing checks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.270" end="00:19.770">Land of the free</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.710" end="00:21.750">If you can afford it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.750" end="00:23.280">Joke is on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.280" end="00:25.130">Being broke is boring</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.130" end="00:26.630">Too fucking bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.490" end="00:28.750">I'm not somebody's daughter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.750" end="00:32.470">Daddy owns the land, the oil in the water</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.470" end="00:33.970">If I had a dollar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.720" end="00:35.880">Then I wouldn't have to bother 'bout the</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.880" end="00:38.070">Bills</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.070" end="00:41.690">I'm so tired of paying rent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.690" end="00:45.210">I'm so tired of the B-I-L-L-S</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.210" end="00:50.100">I'm so tired of writing checks (checks, yeah, ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.100" end="00:51.600">Benjamins, Presidents (uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.320" end="00:52.820">Queens are irrelevant (uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.790" end="00:55.560">I can't even afford the jeans I'm wearing (uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.560" end="00:57.220">The shoes that I'm standing in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.220" end="00:59.430">Bills</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.430" end="01:04.250">I'm so tired of life's expense</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.250" end="01:05.910">I bought a banana</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.910" end="01:07.810">Cost me 20 dollars</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.810" end="01:09.540">Got a fucking ticket</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.540" end="01:11.400">Rather get run over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.400" end="01:12.900">If I had a dollar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.750" end="01:14.520">Then I wouldn't have to bother</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.520" end="01:16.370">But I'm feeling kinda lucky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.370" end="01:18.610">That I didn't finish college 'cause</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.610" end="01:20.830">Bills</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.830" end="01:24.320">I'm so tired of paying rent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.320" end="01:27.830">I'm so tired of the B-I-L-L-S</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.830" end="01:32.910">I'm so tired of writing checks (checks, yeah, ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.910" end="01:34.410">Benjamins, Presidents (uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.240" end="01:35.740">Queens are irrelevant (uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.580" end="01:37.900">I can't even afford the jeans I'm wearing (uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.900" end="01:39.780">The shoes I'm standing in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.780" end="01:41.280">Glamorous, palaces (uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.280" end="01:43.350">Gold and silver plated chalices (uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.350" end="01:44.850">It's cool to be scandalous (uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.840" end="01:47.090">If your pearls are looking fabulous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.090" end="01:49.340">Bills</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.340" end="01:57.340">I'm so tired of life's expense</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.310" end="02:04.790">Bills (if I had a dollar, then I wouldn't have to bother 'bout the-)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.790" end="02:08.350">Bills (if I had a dollar, then I wouldn't have to bother 'bout the-)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.350" end="02:11.720">Bills (if I had a dollar, then I wouldn't have to bother 'bout the-)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.720" end="02:13.620">Bills</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.620" end="02:17.620" /></div></body></tt>